        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>To the powers that be,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>First off, thank you for your additional efforts over the holidays. Recieved my IR box with Ambuscade and Unity. REALLY appreciate the promo Wraith.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your gift has whetted my new desire to acquire as many promos as possible. I was too slow to donate to the development fund, but am now on this promo mission.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>How would you advise me sate my new obsessive addiction?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Devoted fan,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Kauboi</p>",
