        "created_at": "2013-02-06T17:57:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe that idea has been thrown around a bit. After the series is complete, an unlimited promo pack would be released that contains the promo heroes and whatnot with some sort of mark to indicate it is a later version to keep the original owners unique.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, yeah. Those without will have to wait for a long while, but in the meantime, all of the pertinent information for each promo card is readily available for use, just not as spiffy.</p>",
