        "created_at": "2013-02-06T19:14:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Paul wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Finally, at some point in the future, we will be releasing an \"unlimited edition\" pack of all of the promo character cards to-date, and it will be widely available for purchase.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nSo those of us without have to wait until \"some point in the future\" (which with a shattered timeline could have been yesterday, or even later still, last week)\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>OH MAN! I can't believe I missed that!&nbsp; Thanks Matchstickman!</p>",
